WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.150
Weighted grades: myth or fact?

2
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:04.500
Myth #1: "If I don't take AP, my GPA goes down."

3
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.050
Fact: Regular classes stay on the 4.0 scale. Only AP, capstone and qualifying college-credit classes would count on a 5.0 scale.

4
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:10.400
Myth #2: "It changes everyone's GPA right away."

5
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.950
Fact: It starts with fall 2027 freshmen, if the Board approves it.

6
00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.100
Myth #3: "Nobody asked students."

7
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.650
Fact: 903 students and 531 caregivers answered district surveys.

8
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.650
Your school. Your say. @spasdstudentvoice
